title: "Hermes Agent on a Personal Computer: Security, Sandboxing, Automation and Reliability Lessons from a Windows/Docker Practitioner Case Study"
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-24"
type: report
abstract: "A de-identified practitioner case study of deploying and hardening an open-source AI agent on a personal Windows computer, examining OS isolation, Docker sandboxing, scheduled automation, Windows path and encoding failures, gateway and messaging exposure, and least-privilege controls."
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
